        "title": "The pie and bar charts below show the percentage of water consumption and use in Australia in 2004. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant. ",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<p><em><strong>The pie and bar charts below show the percentage of water consumption and use in Australia in 2004. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.&nbsp;</strong></em></p>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Water consumption in Australia in 2004</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqPldEHP5oO9Eqxr2kRlefpxgtb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">Đề b&agrave;i Water consumption in Australia in 2004 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả 2 biểu đồ:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K5OBdqIlGouytXxTZrYltqgDgLd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>[Pie chart]</strong> thể hiện tỷ lệ ti&ecirc;u thụ nước của c&aacute;c nh&oacute;m đối tượng kh&aacute;c nhau</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WgDzdtXfiofoEnxwObml5yP1gf8\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>[Bar chart]</strong> thể hiện tỷ lệ nước được d&ugrave;ng trong hộ gia đ&igrave;nh cho c&aacute;c mục đ&iacute;ch kh&aacute;c nhau</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SWxDdnrhaoWRUmxj4hJlZurJgBh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/124/ielts-writing-task-1-aim-6570-internal?collection=lesson&amp;item=4\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tuyệt đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> v&agrave;&nbsp; <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"> </a></strong></span>trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VcIwdcyD3obYdJxrVgZlkQwIgAb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Water Consumption in Australia với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: pie chart - c&aacute;c nh&oacute;m đối tượng ti&ecirc;u thụ nước - bar chart - c&aacute;c mục đ&iacute;ch sử dụng nước - năm 2004 - Australia.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IFf1dMjRDok8HtxlXSUlI37OgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QZuWdhvTyoJJNVxWwVAljRgBgHc\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề mixed charts, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ULsddpDdjoW0r2xvsfPlKOqQgYd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>Residential chiếm đa số tuyệt đối trong tổng lượng nước ti&ecirc;u thụ. Garden v&agrave; bathroom l&agrave; hai mục đ&iacute;ch sử dụng nước nhiều nhất.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch chia mỗi chart v&agrave;o 1 BODY, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P06AdwVAioetUFx6MzilxCvvgvf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Pie chart</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GhM4dPyRPoNvb6x8WBIlQCq3gRh\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RTw3d71u6oqB6gxt1OPl0dwYgVf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu của residential v&agrave; industrial </strong><em>(residential lớn nhất với 70%, gấp hơn 6 lần industrial với chỉ 11%</em><em>)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N03VdxJKNojCCFx4GyOlu6N3goc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu của business</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><em>(chiếm 10%, thấp hơn industrial chỉ 1%</em><em>)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DJfVd1SwMoBsShxctfBlgm5hgTc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>số liệu của goverment v&agrave; other</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><em>(goverment v&agrave; other chiếm rất &iacute;t, lần lượt 6% v&agrave; 3%, cộng lại chưa đến 1/10 tổng số</em><em>)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R1qldBVmjoSw2exeRmmlXm6Gg3e\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Bar chart</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R1qldBVmjoSw2exeRmmlXm6Gg3e\">\n<div data-lark-html-role=\"root\"><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"33\">Theo </span><strong><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"34\">Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></span></strong><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"35\">, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</span></div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ulc6dDDQdoRBXWxCe4AltRW4g0c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu của garden v&agrave; bathroom </strong><em>(garden chiếm cao nhất với 28%, hơn bathroom một ch&uacute;t, với 27%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lwlud9uGloD1s8xXF2elrCoGgpd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu của washing clothes </strong><em>(xếp thứ 3, chiếm 20%, 1/5 tổng số</em><em>)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZMYddPAusoVRRYx5A56lg7EdgCf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu của toilet v&agrave; kitchen&nbsp;</strong><em>(chiếm tỉ lệ nhỏ, lần lượt l&agrave; 15% v&agrave; 10%. Đ&aacute;ng ch&uacute; &yacute;, gardening cao gấp 3 lần kitchen</em><em>)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RuxRdF0GuoF09YxnotEl2yn7gbj\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TN6Fd9B0PohTNjxAWltlSG3sgUg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi muốn n&oacute;i về <strong>\"c&aacute;ch ti&ecirc;u thụ nước\" </strong>th&igrave; ngo&agrave;i cụm <strong>\"water use\" </strong>như trong đề b&agrave;i th&igrave; m&igrave;nh cũng c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng cụm&nbsp;<strong>\"how water was utilized\"</strong> hoặc <strong>\"water usage\" </strong>nha.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BJ6PdRsSJoeHp9xWPaZlbXKVgme\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ: </strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IY0UdZPGNoyAjGxvfYUlI9VxgOc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">As for <strong>how water was utilized</strong> in Australian homes, garden watering was the primary purpose.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IY0UdZPGNoyAjGxvfYUlI9VxgOc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Washing clothes ranked third, comprising exactly one-fifth of household&nbsp;<strong>water usage</strong>.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
