        "writing_graph_description": "1/ Chart Description:\nChart 1 - Pie Chart:\n\nChart type: Pie chart\nTitle: Water consumption\nTime period: 2004\nUnits: Percentage (%)\nCategories: Residential, Industrial, Business, Government, Other\n\nChart 2 - Bar Chart:\n\nChart type: Bar chart\nTitle: Residential Water Use (%)\nTime period: 2004\nUnits: Percentage (%)\nX-axis: Water use purposes (Bathroom, Toilet, Washing clothes, Kitchen, Garden)\nY-axis: Percentage (0-30%)\n\n\n2/ Data in CSV Format:\nPie Chart - Water Consumer:\ncsv\nSector,Percentage\nResidential,70%\nIndustrial,11%\nBusiness,10%\nGovernment,6%\nOther,3%\nBar Chart - Residential Water Use:\ncsv\nPurpose,Percentage\nBathroom,27%\nToilet,15%\nWashing clothes,20%\nKitchen,10%\nGarden,28%",
